.oahs/
.playwright-mcp/

# A third party's product manual and architecture reference were tracked here (2.1 MB
# of someone else's copyrighted documentation, in a public repo). The ANALYSIS derived
# from them is ours and stays — docs/oahs/05-actorium-portal-parity.md, and the §11/§12
# roadmap sections that cite them. The source documents are not ours to redistribute.
docs/ref/*.pdf

# Build artifacts. These were TRACKED, which had two costs: every source change produced
# a 12,000-line generated diff that made the real change unreviewable, and nothing ever
# verified the committed bundle matched the source it claimed to be — so a stale bundle
# could ship silently (`make clean` also deleted these tracked files, dirtying the tree).
# The quickstart builds before it runs (`make serve` depends on `build`) and both
# Dockerfiles build, so nothing depended on them being in git.
apps/oahs/bin/
apps/spine-api/public/
